  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For a simple harmonic motion in a mass spring system shown, the surface is frictionless. When the mass of the block is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>, the angular frequency is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>. When the mass block is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> the angular frequency is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math> is :</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0048_674e82b0ea6a.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 79px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In case of SHM in spring-block system, angular frequency is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>.</p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
